  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for inclusive, local level dialogue to rebuild trust in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the action is to support Lebanese society to re-establish trust and dialogue and to develop concrete, local level options and suggestions for short- and mid-term change that can be implemented despite the current political, socio-economic and financial crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
